32
00:02:19,534 --> 00:02:23,760
The backbone of the internet, the long wires between cities, were owned and paid for by the government.

33
00:02:24,014 --> 00:02:26,880
Meant for universities and labs, you weren't allowed to use them for business.

34
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:30,320
